      "maskType": "slrealtimeenablelogging",
      "maskDescription": "Enable or disable the file logging service.\n\nWhen the input port value is true, the block enables the file logging service on the target computer, and the File Log blocks record data. When the input port value is false, the block disables file logging on the target computer, and the File Log blocks do not record data.",
